	"notes": [
		"Configured from the pinned main commit; native tasks have not been run by CinaCLI.",
		"Use pnpm 11.17.0, the checked-in workspace catalog, and the existing Vite+ task/cache runner; do not replace it with recursive npm or Turbo calls.",
		"Many build/test capabilities are Vite+ tasks in vite.config.ts rather than package.json scripts. The root native scripts preserve their dependency graph, code generation and timeout behavior.",
		"lint:check is the isolated lint task. The full lint/types:check scripts include build and may write generated files and artifacts.",
		"17 gatekeeper packages have wrangler.jsonc and are Workers. gatekeeper-kit and mcp-shared are libraries; Worker identification is configuration-based.",
		"Engineering task orchestration does not change CapnWeb application RPC, connector credentials, approval queues or business authorization.",
		"Backend/router/Worker deployment, release/R2 uploads, previews, live billing audits and provider evals are excluded. Components without declared tasks await scoped native verification."
	],
